<title>SPAIN: Telefonica 9-mth profit seen up 21.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Telefonica 9-mth profit seen up 21.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forecasts for nine-month results for Spain's Telefonica group. Market forecasts based on simple averages (figures in billions of pesetas).</p>
<p>			     Jan-Sept 96  Jan-Sept 95    RANGE</p>
<p>Operating margin	  795.94	 763.94     790.75-800.00</p>
<p>Operating profit	  398.57	 382.87     388.78-410.00</p>
<p>Attributable profit     122.22	 100.39     120.00-124.73</p>
<p>Contributors: AB Asesores, BBV Interactivos, Credit Lyonnais Securities, Ibersecurities, Inverban.</p>
<p>The company expects to announce results this week.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom + 34 1 585 2160</p>
